OL,3,AJamal Edwards' sister on celebrating
OL,4,ASBTV's 20-year legacy and hopes of
OL,5,Adiscovering new talent
OL,6,
OL,7,FLaunched in the early days of YouTube
OL,8,Fwith homemade videos featuring emerging
OL,9,Fartists, online music channel SBTV went
OL,10,Fon to shake up the music industry.
OL,12,FPioneering DJ and entrepreneur Jamal
OL,13,FEdwards founded the grime and rap music
OL,14,Fplatform back in 2006 after he got a
OL,15,Fcamcorder for Christmas and started
OL,16,Ffilming his friends on the council
OL,17,Festate where he grew up in west London.
OL,19,FIt helped launch the careers of many
OL,20,Facts including Dave, Ed Sheeran, Jessie
OL,21,FJ and Skepta.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
