OL,3,AJamal Edwards' sister on celebrating
OL,4,ASBTV's 20-year legacy and hopes of
OL,5,Adiscovering new talent
OL,6,
OL,7,FBy the age of 23, Jamal was a
OL,8,Fmultimillionaire and channelling his
OL,9,Fsuccess into helping others. He was
OL,10,Fawarded an MBE for his services to
OL,11,Fmusic in 2014.
